{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_4ef8de170c14325b-1225\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>視帝陳展鵬與太太單文柔（Phoebe）近日飛往馬來西亞歎世界。單文柔日前於社交平台分享了一輯在當地拍攝的放閃靚相，兩公婆特意換上傳統服飾，深度體驗當地文化。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_4ef8de170c14325b-1226\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>相中可見，單文柔身穿一襲深藍色精緻刺繡「娘惹服」（Kebaya），配搭鮮艷桃紅色印花長裙並披上頭巾，極具古典美；陳展鵬則以一身紮染短袖配白褲、戴上墨鏡，隨性又不失型格。二人置身於建築宏偉的清真寺內及戶外景致前合照，其中一張照片，單文柔更甜蜜地將頭輕靠在陳展鵬背脊上，閃爆一眾網民。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_4ef8de170c14325b-1226\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4a45d0a5-69bb-441d-bd39-377c08f90aea.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026314Udda8vs1789635186.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4a45d0a5-69bb-441d-bd39-377c08f90aea.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"24e6a101-51a8-4edb-a2ea-7ab7ce80df4b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20269UX6NQCFaJ1789635186.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"24e6a101-51a8-4edb-a2ea-7ab7ce80df4b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_4ef8de170c14325b-1227\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>單文柔興奮寫道：「每次嚟到馬來西亞，心情都特別好！☀️🇲🇾一直都好想試著呢度嘅傳統服飾，今次終於有機會著上呢套超精緻嘅『娘惹服』（Kebaya）啦！刺繡真係好靚好細緻，好鍾意呢種有古典美嘅傳統衫。😍✨」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_4ef8de170c14325b-1227\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_4ef8de170c14325b-1228\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>她又幽默自爆：「話說回來，展鵬有大馬人血統，所以我都算係『大馬新抱』呀！」並詢問大家其造型是否合格。帖文一出，一眾網民與粉絲隨即留言狂讚：「呢個大馬新抱100分」、「穿傳統服飾好有古典美」、「第一眼真係以為馬來本地人！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T09:21:05.585847+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":432,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}